Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wajah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,ad kamaai umeed se kam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,aur AI par bhaari kharcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Free cash flow yaani kharche ke
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,baad bacha cash,
