Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Par reports ke mutabik,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indian IT shares ulta upar gaye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aapke paas US fund hai?
